{"title":"Embedded Developer Roadmap","role":"Embedded Developer","summary":"An Embedded Developer designs and develops software that runs directly on embedded devices such as microcontrollers, industrial controllers, automotive ECUs, medical devices, consumer electronics, robotics systems, and IoT products.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"Computer Engineering"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Embedded Developer designs and develops software that runs directly on embedded devices such as microcontrollers, industrial controllers, automotive ECUs, medical devices, consumer electronics, robotics systems, and IoT products."},{"type":"p","text":"The role sits at the intersection of:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Computer Engineering","Electronics","C/C++","Operating Systems","Hardware","Real-Time Systems"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong embedded developer should understand both what the hardware does and how software controls it."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Embedded developers can specialize in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Embedded Software Development"},{"text":"Firmware Engineering"},{"text":"Embedded Linux"},{"text":"RTOS Development"},{"text":"Automotive Embedded Systems"},{"text":"IoT Firmware"},{"text":"Robotics Embedded Systems"},{"text":"Industrial Automation"},{"text":"Medical Device Firmware"},{"text":"Consumer Electronics"},{"text":"Aerospace & Avionics Embedded Systems"},{"text":"Edge AI"},{"text":"Embedded Security"},{"text":"Device Drivers"},{"text":"Systems Programming"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 1 — Programming & Electronics Foundation","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build strong programming fundamentals."},{"type":"h","text":"Programming"},{"type":"p","text":"Prioritize:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"C"},{"text":"C++"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Data Structures"},